02:52.860 --> 03:00.260
So, we're getting a little bit of local direction after retracing, which gives me a little bit of hope that possibly, you know,

03:00.320 --> 03:05.160
the higher low is already in on the daily time frame or that will bottom out somewhere around here.

03:06.260 --> 03:12.760
