03:21.760 --> 03:23.280
You know, decent follow-through so far.

03:24.000 --> 03:25.040
4-hour as well.

03:25.720 --> 03:29.960
You know, we are currently trying to continue the uptrend after we put in a higher low.

03:30.040 --> 03:31.560
We're now trying to put in a higher high.

03:32.020 --> 03:35.260
We may have already technically, but it was very insignificant.

03:35.500 --> 03:38.560
I'd like to see money flow actually put in, you know, a significant higher high.

03:38.860 --> 03:42.800
The mid-term time frame is, you know, a bit of flopping and groping here.

03:42.980 --> 03:47.280
But, you know, we still can't say that possibly the uptrend is continuing.

03:47.620 --> 03:50.000
You know, we kind of put in a double bottom here with this one.

03:50.120 --> 03:54.140
But we could still say that, you know, there's hope that overall direction continues here.

03:54.940 --> 03:59.880
And these mid-term time frames, we're seeing things retrace after taking out all-time high.

03:59.980 --> 04:03.260
