06:39.920 --> 06:46.300
As we were forming this triangle, we saw price making higher lows with momentum and money flow making lower lows.

06:46.420 --> 06:47.520
That's called a hidden divergence.

06:47.720 --> 06:49.900
It's kind of the opposite of a regular divergence.

06:50.520 --> 06:56.240
And following us getting that last move down to the triangle low, we started trying to break the triangle to the upside.

06:56.240 --> 07:02.560
